Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.30,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.01,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被爱
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.01,0:22:07.39,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.10,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.15,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到归处
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}没有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.29,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.42,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}将自己的名字刻在心里
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.42,0:22:37.46,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.63,0:22:43.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在过去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.26,0:22:50.06,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.39,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.39,0:22:55.52,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:23:01.49,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.61,0:23:05.62,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.58,0:23:19.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.30,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.01,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.01,0:22:07.39,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.15,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.29,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.42,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.42,0:22:37.46,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.63,0:22:43.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.26,0:22:50.06,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.39,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.39,0:22:55.52,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:23:01.49,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.61,0:23:05.62,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.58,0:23:19.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.30,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.01,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:07.39,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.10,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.90,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.86,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.15,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}也找不到归处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.36,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}没有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.91,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.79,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.29,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.42,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}将自己的名字刻在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:37.46,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:43.72,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}留在过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:50.06,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.39,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:55.52,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:23:01.49,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs55}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:05.62,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs55}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.66,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:19.34,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:59.30,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.01,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:07.39,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.10,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:13.90,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.86,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.15,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.36,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.91,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:27.79,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:30.29,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.42,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:37.46,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:43.72,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:50.06,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.39,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:55.52,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:23:01.49,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:05.62,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.66,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:19.34,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}きっと誰かの光だから
